{"parse": {"title": "三重赋格-08", "pageid": 110912, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E9%87%8D%E8%B5%8B%E6%A0%BC-07\" title=\"三重赋格-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">三重赋格-08</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">三重赋格</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.81.B0.E7.83.AC.E8.B5.8B.E6.A0.BC\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"灰烬赋格\">灰烬赋格</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 灰烬赋格</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Fugue of Tragedies</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_zhanhao1\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_zhanhao1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>沃尔克死于傲慢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>他的谎言化作了那枚射向他的子弹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>但这些都不重要了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>你在后悔没拦住帕蒂塔？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我不知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>在今天医院撤离之前，帕蒂塔会被枪决。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>连里的士兵没人愿意动手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>最后我们一起抓了阄，弗兰兹抽中了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>沉重流淌着，而这个世界上没人会知道卡戎的表情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>那张相片的主人怎么样了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>法比安死了，我今天会埋葬他，和医院留下的其他死者一起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的连长沉默着向他投来视线，似乎踌躇不定着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>一切结束时，我回到野战医院，法比安已经死去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我没能把照片给他，告诉他安娜在等他回家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>艾伯哈特还是下了决断。他从口袋里取出一封揉皱的信递给卡戎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>威利给了我一封信，是早上从后方送来的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>……法比安和妻子居住的小楼，在一周前消失于一场大火中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……什么，为什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>每天都有太多的噩耗送去后方，也并不是每个人都能承受等待带来的痛苦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我……法比安……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我没能履行我的诺言，在他死前陪他最后一程。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我没能履行我的诺言，在他死前陪他最后一程。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>弗兰兹救下不会死于子弹的我，但我能与他说的只剩抱歉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>弗兰兹救下不会死于子弹的我，但我能与他说的只剩抱歉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>而帕蒂塔决意已定，我们的承诺毫无意义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>而帕蒂塔决意已定，我们的承诺毫无意义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>这一切都毫无意义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-525901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-525901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-525901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>你不后悔自己没有拦下帕蒂塔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>但是我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>但是“我”后悔没有救下瓦尔特。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_gongmu1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_gongmu1\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_gongmu1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/Cg-3_0_bg_gongmu1.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_gongmu1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/Cg-3_0_bg_gongmu1.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_gongmu1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/Cg-3_0_bg_gongmu1.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_gongmu1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>负责护送医院撤离的士兵零散在四周，人们漫不经心地聊着天，指尖捻起卷烟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>帕蒂塔安静地坐在一边，她坐得笔直，目光也放得笔直。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>看见卡戎的靠近，帕蒂塔左右的士兵站了起来，向他点点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡戎取出两包卷烟递给他们，他们挥手婉拒，随后离开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>今天是个不错的天气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>不像你和瓦尔特离开那天，阴雨连绵，雾气朦胧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>我甚至看不清车窗后你们的脸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>你的心满足了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她笑了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>满足？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>向深渊中填补一抔土，只会听见一声回响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>除此之外，一无所有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>没有必要再谈论我了，保罗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>你呢？你要继续埋葬所有逝去的士兵吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>是的，这条路很漫长，只要战争存在，它就会一直延续下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>哇！你成为士兵之前可讲不出这种话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>你上战场其实是念书来了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……不，没有那回事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>我们再见面之后，你连一个玩笑都没讲过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>你变得太无趣了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>那真是抱歉，即使是讲笑话，我也只感到疲惫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我现在是一具无趣又疲惫的行尸走肉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>没关系，你至少还会自嘲——虽然你讲得很认真。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>士兵们骚动起来，几道目光有意无意地向他们扫来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>帕蒂塔显然注意到了这些，她注视着士兵们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>你知道我其实还蛮机灵的吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>我发现了一些关于你的事情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>一些你没有意识到，或者你不想意识到的事情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>不重要了，谢谢你，卡戎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的指骨微微抽动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>我希望我不是最后一个看见你痛苦灵魂的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>我希望你可以找到真正的自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我没有什么自己。他想要这样回答她，却如鲠在喉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她站了起来，向士兵们走去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>帕蒂塔——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她没有回头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡戎看见正在拿起枪的弗兰兹，后者意识到他的目光，僵硬而冷漠地扭过了头。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_at_karong3_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_at_karong3_zone\"><img alt=\"3_0_at_karong3_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Cg-3_0_at_karong3_zone.png/600px-Cg-3_0_at_karong3_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"572\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Cg-3_0_at_karong3_zone.png/900px-Cg-3_0_at_karong3_zone.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Cg-3_0_at_karong3_zone.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1132\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>有什么东西从卡戎不存在的五脏中出现，然后涌向了他的四肢百骸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它的每一次牵动都令卡戎不适，但他依然只是看着弗兰兹将子弹上膛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>弗兰兹的面孔变得模糊而又陌生，似乎他在用麻木的士兵面孔让自己继续动作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它消弭殆尽了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_at_karong1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_at_karong1\"><img alt=\"3_0_at_karong1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/Cg-3_0_at_karong1.png/600px-Cg-3_0_at_karong1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/Cg-3_0_at_karong1.png/900px-Cg-3_0_at_karong1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/Cg-3_0_at_karong1.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_at_karong1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>弗兰兹不再看卡戎，他匆匆走入士兵之中，随他们鱼贯上车。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_at_karong3_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_at_karong3_zone\"><img alt=\"3_0_at_karong3_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Cg-3_0_at_karong3_zone.png/600px-Cg-3_0_at_karong3_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"572\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Cg-3_0_at_karong3_zone.png/900px-Cg-3_0_at_karong3_zone.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Cg-3_0_at_karong3_zone.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1132\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>车群发出启动的轰鸣，碾过焦土与将死的草植，一路绝尘而去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>世界又是寂静的了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>只有寂静的生命在等待他，等待一抔抔的沙土，将他们葬入土地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>法比安，帕蒂塔，还有无数死在战场上，年轻而饱受折磨的面孔。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_at_karong2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_at_karong2\"><img alt=\"3_0_at_karong2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-3_0_at_karong2.png/600px-Cg-3_0_at_karong2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-3_0_at_karong2.png/900px-Cg-3_0_at_karong2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-3_0_at_karong2.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_at_karong2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他独自向他们走去，履行他最后的，也是唯一的职责。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他拾起铲子，扬起尘土。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "三重赋格-08"}}